<p>Matter is being converted every two weeks to anti-matter, and back again. Apparently, the Doctor who was 'annihilated' was retroactively removed from existence. But it seems to have been kinda hap-hazard, as memories of him readily exist, and you can refer to him. It's just, everything he ever did personally has been undone on some level.</p>
